g the quiz and rest of us can keep doing chat questions", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-23T20:06:17Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "As of now we have a pretty high volume", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-23T20:06:29Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Yeah \"all of the above\"", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-23T20:08:05Z", "username": "Sushant", "text": "yeah sure i was suggesting just to increase participation", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-23T20:08:31Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "No 100%, agree with that", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-23T20:15:34Z", "username": "Meghna", "text": "we could also fix a daily quiz hour (or hours for different time zones) Everyone can ask and answer during that time? Can be more engagement if people know it’s time for trivia on the group at so and so time!\nAdditionally, like you suggested, could also do a voluntary member-hosted WhatsApp quiz periodically with 1 member asking the questions.  But I think a lot of folks love the daily trivia", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-23T20:31:03Z", "username": "Aditi Bapat", "text": "This sounds like best of all worlds. I have all the groups on mute to minimize notification frequency so unless I'm physically in the group, I miss most of the daily trivia questions buried among 100s of messages. But they're fun nevertheless as a kind of TIL.\nAnd since so many of our members also make quizzes of their own, a weekly one-member trivia sesh would be for anyone having a whole deck prepared.\nDaily trivia for easier questions, dedicated weekly quizzes for niche and harder questions.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-23T21:06:01Z", "username": "Shvetal", "text": "So this is the safe space for Sushant group?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-23T22:02:29Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Why did you delete the question, we never got the answer", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]